 - **Themes**: Dark by default; follow the system, or pick Light, Gruvbox Material Dark Hard or Tokyo Night Moon from **View → Theme** or the button in the status bar. The editor, preview and code colours all follow the choice, and Clarity remembers it.
 - **Links in the preview**: web links (http and https) open in your browser. Links to other `.md` files inside the open folder open in Clarity. `#anchors` jump within the preview, including footnotes. All other links do nothing.
